---
/** DAQ module block diagram: inputs → converters → MCU → interfaces. Drawn from the case-study text. */
---

<figure class="diagram" data-reveal>
  <div class="diagram__scroll" data-lenis-prevent>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 560" role="img" aria-labelledby="daq-block-title daq-block-desc">
      <title id="daq-block-title">DAQ module block diagram</title>
      <desc id="daq-block-desc">
        Eight voltage inputs and four 4–20 mA current inputs pass through protection into an AD4111 ADC. Two RTD
        inputs go to two MAX31865 converters. Both connect to the STM32H563 over SPI. The MCU drives an AD3531 DAC
        over SPI, whose four outputs are buffered by op-amps at a gain of 2. The MCU connects to a LAN8742A Ethernet
        PHY over RMII and to an RS-485 transceiver over UART. A 24 V input feeds an LT3514 triple buck and LDOs.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="daq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7.5" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 z" class="d-head"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- Input ports -->
      <g>
        <text class="d-t" x="148" y="92" text-anchor="end">8× VOLTAGE</text>
        <text class="d-s" x="148" y="110" text-anchor="end">or 4 differential</text>
        <rect class="d-term" x="154" y="91" width="8" height="8"></rect>
        <text class="d-t" x="148" y="172" text-anchor="end">4× CURRENT</text>
        <text class="d-s" x="148" y="190" text-anchor="end">4–20 mA</text>
        <rect class="d-term" x="154" y="171" width="8" height="8"></rect>
        <text class="d-t" x="148" y="304" text-anchor="end">2× RTD</text>
        <rect class="d-term" x="154" y="296" width="8" height="8"></rect>
      </g>

      <!-- Protection -->
      <rect class="d-box" x="200" y="60" width="130" height="150"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="265" y="130" text-anchor="middle">PROTECTION</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="265" y="148" text-anchor="middle">TVS + RC</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M162 95 H200" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <path class="d-line" d="M162 175 H200" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>

      <!-- ADC -->
      <rect class="d-box" x="380" y="70" width="150" height="130"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="455" y="130" text-anchor="middle">AD4111</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="455" y="148" text-anchor="middle">ADC · 8 V + 4 I</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M330 95 H380" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <path class="d-line" d="M330 175 H380" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>

      <!-- RTD converters -->
      <rect class="d-box" x="380" y="265" width="150" height="70"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="455" y="296" text-anchor="middle">2× MAX31865</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="455" y="314" text-anchor="middle">RTD converter</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M162 300 H380" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>

      <!-- MCU -->
      <rect class="d-box d-box--key" x="590" y="50" width="150" height="390"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="665" y="238" text-anchor="middle">STM32H563</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="665" y="256" text-anchor="middle">MCU</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M530 135 H590" marker-start="url(#daq-arrow)" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <text class="d-s" x="560" y="127" text-anchor="middle">SPI</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M530 300 H590" marker-start="url(#daq-arrow)" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <text class="d-s" x="560" y="292" text-anchor="middle">SPI</text>

      <!-- Analog outputs -->
      <rect class="d-box" x="800" y="70" width="130" height="70"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="865" y="101" text-anchor="middle">AD3531</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="865" y="119" text-anchor="middle">DAC</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M740 105 H800" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <text class="d-s" x="770" y="97" text-anchor="middle">SPI</text>
      <rect class="d-box" x="960" y="70" width="110" height="70"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="1015" y="101" text-anchor="middle">4× BUFFER</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="1015" y="119" text-anchor="middle">op-amp, gain 2</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M930 105 H960" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <path class="d-line" d="M1070 105 H1092" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <rect class="d-term" x="1094" y="101" width="8" height="8"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="1110" y="101">4× ANALOG</text>
      <text class="d-t" x="1110" y="119">OUT</text>

      <!-- Ethernet -->
      <rect class="d-box" x="800" y="220" width="270" height="70"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="935" y="251" text-anchor="middle">LAN8742A</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="935" y="269" text-anchor="middle">Ethernet PHY</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M740 255 H800" marker-start="url(#daq-arrow)" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <text class="d-s" x="770" y="247" text-anchor="middle">RMII</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M1070 255 H1094" marker-start="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <rect class="d-term" x="1094" y="251" width="8" height="8"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="1110" y="251">ETHERNET</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="1110" y="269">RJ45</text>

      <!-- RS-485 -->
      <rect class="d-box" x="800" y="340" width="270" height="70"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="935" y="371" text-anchor="middle">RS-485 TRANSCEIVER</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M740 375 H800" marker-start="url(#daq-arrow)" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <text class="d-s" x="770" y="367" text-anchor="middle">UART</text>
      <path class="d-line" d="M1070 375 H1094" marker-start="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <rect class="d-term" x="1094" y="371" width="8" height="8"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="1110" y="379">RS-485</text>

      <!-- Power -->
      <text class="d-t" x="148" y="512" text-anchor="end">24 V IN</text>
      <rect class="d-term" x="154" y="504" width="8" height="8"></rect>
      <path class="d-line" d="M162 508 H200" marker-end="url(#daq-arrow)"></path>
      <rect class="d-box d-box--ghost" x="200" y="478" width="870" height="60"></rect>
      <text class="d-t" x="220" y="512">LT3514 TRIPLE BUCK + LDOS</text>
      <text class="d-s" x="1050" y="512" text-anchor="end">rails for every block, see power tree</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Block diagram. Drawn from the design, not exported from it.</figcaption>
</figure>
